  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "羅網四張，鳥無所翔。征伐困極，飢渴不食。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2cc4499a28fd3024d756bd0aabe82262742084038586a28cc4c1adee2c585271",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a14ed57f93ba8464f182dcdae8e771f84d2e0baaa5bedb0210cb27b4616f4af0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "寄生無根，如過浮雲。立本不固，斯須落去。更為枯樹。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3257427595f79a8d54991c60371dfa2e7fd87749311e454510b4601e144ba7c0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:32a69e2f075b28625cde498229ec8582d21b83693ff47b2f8b505183c971a579"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "人無定法，綬降牛出。蛇雄走趨，陽不制陰。宜其家困。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:575960590b9fce365a91f93dd6a0d6ffecf89a70cbf133dc2e7d2ac7e70fe1a9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e669672314505484d25aaad742998f5fcb0b5197c31e6182ce3a296748f331e9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "眾鳥所翔，中有大怪。九身無頭，魂驚魄去。不可以居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:48d1eb512ef13f9f2886fe6b0e4e3650aaee5f0804b64c448318be9b0914a14c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d783ce601af8c94945e8e8104a2638add2114f726d118224ab4630b4cfa1dd86"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "封涿溝瀆，灌潰國邑。人宿口中，民多病疾。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5b28e97603fa958f03e51408fd462fe7a2437a5142814f2544a662a41c413c60",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9289b14b4adf347521485fbf0f09584bd2f57d909dd39651d484273e6b32923a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "奮趐鼓翼，翱翔外國。消遙徙倚，來歸溫室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:95531a7b06949e6120185aba95ce6dde54dfaafd830732170f4e6cbd552ff7b8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0f4d2eb944f9cb9111f9dc2c077f4e4c8a338c9872261e332ab67bd026eeb1c3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "秋蠶不成，冬種不生。設王逆理，棄其寵名。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:009de7bad4cf1d0faab8b21a245b366a8de1bf80a6ab993a52bf7409c8a16a4d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4b731188d2da73d26af6d095403b57a516e645104c28dffa1c7b74c010334ec7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "衛侯東遊，惑於少姬。亡我考妣，久迷不來。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3a29cd0c05760d32614b2014b72f6b02c400bc73d0b7dc19f386359ee82ca9dc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ebbf1ab62e3e069b1582e1e1bd280e227083773d3269ad6f95ff51061d585bf1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "鳥會雀合，與惡相得。鴟鴞相酬，為心所賊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:305dbb3e522c4bb3737d6c77785088737205bddf0269abcf32133c38d13e28f8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:70f0a510a23becdd69fc20b8fab337c565c8f594c79ebc8d93dd3db5bc679041"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "雞鳴無距，與雀格鬥。趐折目盲，為仇所傷。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2981b8693be137d7cdbf09889c058badf668d6ba45df0997512c16c05598f6ad",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:669414e4b58271d4bff6f0e289c56e58bebc4dc6ff82a11178d568be8d702140"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "木生內蠹，上下相賊。禍亂我國。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:baf9159a73044a52ee3c86efe09e7c2bca348f1fa86389d6bcb579195db29151",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f0ba04c53ec41307159a15cdf747f21f533e1e16b2080f5941108d059f97f6ca"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "延陵適魯，觀樂太史。車鄰白顛，知秦興起。卒兼其國，一統為主。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1bbe26106479dd7d49d2845bfeb47cfec8410c43e5f1acb459288746b6db8a1a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b49a219665997a885ecdf79698144feb51c63bb716b2c7b344a04458c5ba669a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "輔相之好，無有休息。時行雲集，所在遇福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ea131b2b968f883227d9cb5a3589926ff70b859e238f18ad8ab7aa348982e610",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ef2ac75487663674fa3a96e6ff5dfe98cfb2c2a0c4214a97d5f7f8ae8306eb5a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "床傾簀折，屋漏垣缺，季姬不愜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d04c559da58e2060e256781e6cfd41d54f9574aac27fa9c07de5d0c5d3a2ca75",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3419b00ff4d6d481aac860bbcbf40575dc5fad341a4eb0410555c89b95f0924d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "東入海口，循流北走。一高一下，五邑失主。七夜六日，死於水浦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:457b63c00830fb7fdf398d6ae5ffda3eae40cc742f227a49001e4d32aaffc9bc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d388eadf39196ae479b364f8d443f906417848f37b43b5b0777078434db22a12"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "群虎入邑，求索肉食。大人守禦，君失其國。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1f0a017c70ad799b6b6c4278be628b58ce1f5d447c566933e18020619190cc48",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ae799400c5bc0e988dddc045ec225a20f7d88c95ace3adae02ed44b4117f7ec7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "四亂不安，東西為患。退身山足，無出邦域。乃得完全，賴其生福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e6a4a06cb121a7612af7d3ab65982a77952b791b74abbd514dba116d839c87f1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:69302919ee3c68f57430bcf2310c8f42820c89ba78d320e9a9defcca161237c4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "叔肸抱冤，祈子自邑。乘遽解患，羊舌以免。賴其生全。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d56303c56da73c4d9abb1ee89f9cf031a5fc3e1ab687fbd77213aab7e65a3aa6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:50a1688fef93665ee315886ddd069783ee4f9cdc87e6458b3987b8ebabb23efd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "延頸望酒，不入我口。深目自若，利得無有。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b762fa3a9feaa88787d35e97b1ed0b4c24a7efead91f1db21b4af9287c2a5944",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:240f50a6748767ac1e344efa0870f541901ac0a5c9b140ca8ec8ef45433744cc"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "仁政之德，恭一日息。成都就邑，日受厥福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:be9ab91d5d65f524fc4ff446e900c03012d49a4449bfa9b378b93dea98bf8824",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2cf61ab5b02c1d04b9955507dbda1dd46cc2a5e8ab946da99dd6e1a5c5299c80"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "牽頭繫尾，屈折幾死。彫世無仁，不知所歸。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6b41a8e0a7d67ff4044e0368c0b06818208d656edd78d643a2e58eee53f9ae12",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d7ece991cd32205d42376def42c8737158e47651b8a4880c452b88a97c5824c2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "教羊逐兔，使魚捕鼠。任非其人，費日無功。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2baecee566c14fe4a216ed3d71e773959735bed71819bd471e0246581e374a48",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:71b1472d05f04a198e51fb701d9899fa2f8154ca9f11b9196343c671cafb1238"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "生角有尾，張孽制家。排揚逐狐，張氏易公。憂禍重凶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1dc92292421acc0e972b5b1f5d4a5a93b49d13471054cc072fefd1bd439da696",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ee367942919da5e2f0741f0d95baf75130a767dfa7fc347165da18f7c1a57aa8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "去安就危，墜陷井池，破我玉螭。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4721a96742c9ea94e31f1be383a711d8b3a5a03cf353e8e623cd8e9be84ad336",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b6abcda1060f7d5cde5d6b00091d90dc0559f1d187edc1f2039eebd7b7238264"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "茹芝餌黃，塗飲玉英。與神通流，長無憂凶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6f9fc6f6530f76bc85d0cf3d656d760fcfba97a8283dfc76f408e11f53c4d00c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bd982bbabc1027e387d78546d5cf760aec3752a67713c25cfb89fadc9fe4c2e9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "體重飛難，未能越關。不離室垣。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d32ac5c3b81ba8d8b9caaa88a11fcb0f1fd38dae5134f2c3d03bfabc9156b4ca",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b7a002fec0b68843d398e56bbd4b4984a03714a2e04fff5beb17ee1ed76b6a66"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "巢成樹折，傷我彝器。伯踒叔跌，凶羊乃追。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7d7aec6f342a9e6739ba7e6735a5f92a3267284402b2652b2dd7267164e6589a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:88a7abfbe7eecc83821b7c9429f576b4f5100983992b60ae7c0e8858499e9447"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "六人俱行，各遺其囊。黃鵠失曉，無以為明。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:866ca8ca8353761cdbd322389be94a60df8bd3ca3aea178b6bd4e7a1160e1261",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:62597f2ba0c818ab3045afd48f395fdf57f26b39da9e13e40b2b2568890279d9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "播枝遷岐，與母分離，絕不相知。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:29481239c97236655b02663896431cb709662618bf4961fa5eaa1de4150dcd97",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:680d64b5273b42f1d465b8287ac6fde660cf6dc1eb315153fc53f76320c404ef"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "迎福開戶，喜隨我後。曹伯愷悌，為宋國主。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8cf450b6425c21071fd569a132f6865190689ff6a29d2781da148d5e8fe61e62",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a6dc789e311c43bd5b7e25fddfcac37ea6c71c5e5abeacbcd14bb2d8732d3113"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "既痴且狂，兩目又盲。箕踞坐喑，名為無用。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:96c9c9f19dbf070713f223498a0150d32975c9f2ade64b557d6d2298e385d8e8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:78a1ffdd1a5cd14dd9a89b8986fdbb1f85cc5f3959687c3a198be0e3e2bfea17"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "金梁銕柱，十年牢固。完全不腐，聖人安處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8625618cff86d4fa29883600ae652411ad869122de4f7a0ace49ef0b8eef6a13",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:31fb13bf09b34dc82b39346cda426ebb6d7fc664c9b3aca256b3457a55bbf078"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "裹糗荷糧，與跖相逢。欲飛不得，為網所獲。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:633cfc8233e6212ad9dc3bc080a0f0376ff79dba312ba77f43bf9e8ff62d40d6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d4bfd73af875ff81f09e32dea4f646354ce6f3c1e1ed62cdedfaad64bfb3fcdc"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "彭生為妖，暴龍作災。盜堯衣裳，聚跖荷兵。青禽照夜，三旦夷亡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7c1e6351741f25fafa7ac79df33156dc43ffd05670a00ff5f505a574dd0285ab",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2b365475a66f4d6d31f53b5edc07a397e76178524c7a6248be966ca2b0c930b3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "褐夫老婦，不能生子，鰥寡居處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3ac7881e32073f1ce2f48e5fded40888b951a51a09a2934e5aafdaad351ecd36",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ce4782a8ef01e3588f827289651db425a03a87000a46b52dcbd67c9592af8b85"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "鷦鷯竊脂，巢於小枝。搖動不安，為風所吹。內寒飄搖，常憂殆危。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:810373e237035254aaf51d2d3427237392ff0b8fed932caf91f7ee5068b05fe7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3493ca111e0bff2356afd46cb4cb7bfe9a7e184acdb24b8d594e6451f906e1fe"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "素車木輿，不任負重。王子出征，憂疑為咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6e2055aed90079a68a256410542aebf13c6d97d97bd5c9e56df292c7e337c4f0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:59226067541197a7a5e09ff50578cc7e3744e46a7c753933477f3f1c09bf382c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "土陷四維，安平不危。利以居止，保其玉女。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bcf1e026b107d50d8e98f18eff4ac712d796dd03363b0e84c758982fa2ec45aa",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4ad229315172a7fd3a3f88f106a5efc3a054ad0ad0e46f013f7eaf0cd3cebcb2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "負牛上山，力劣行難。烈風雨雪，遮遏我前。中道復還。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5e9d4409256e04b627e752a4a93206b387e9fc9137c72a41926ff3ef94d2aaf2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6860266eea84ca2fa0753dfab907d55d0c3d6e0092232e768e088b731b359027"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "金城銕郭，上下同力。政平民親，寇不敢賊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0c9aa4a271fc4194d885e53a8bce382706856565238c0a09d6bbe3d3b2720ae5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e50b18414f9e0021fbc01eb28322eeda315cf1e3db8180de707885ad0a171f53"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "清潔淵塞，為讒所言。證訓詰情，繫於枳溫。甘棠聽斷，昭然蒙恩。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6765c77b1d3f7e954ad06c6f7d24ca0ff74eaec7b1910554f5dd4c9b9cc367b9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3e1fad2deca789cdd9f2bd82166f6bc2798ac15f41372cdaec7c2ba386a71102"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "皋陶聽理，岐伯悅喜。西登華道，東歸無咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:410705864a4bf11162eff6332724f1029a2bacde590b91e19c30279c969e3bdf",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:35cd0b0561087661040be7c802197fc62513a4637b763fbb66e25afa84f750c6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "低頭竊視，有所畏避。行作不利，酒酸魚敗。眾莫貪嗜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9ec609fa464d86bc7b57d00b15c59dbd15574bfd76bc132bb0a1b3261f9397b7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9760e7c6feaf2cc08fd2d06e6851d308961ae1fa4664cffebce0078e3b7e9026"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "十雉百雛，常與母俱。抱雞搏虎，誰肯為娛。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0356cb29cb087cdc72dbdef7dda7c2dcf0a0386cb3d756b58d54b524f234fd86",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ab243a93a1b083b4ab0f8a55c24fe5c8fb7572daeb0ea578203c2653fc8c824a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "高阜山陵，峻阤顛崩。為國妖祥，元后以薨。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cd01fad99c378f289944075fc31e68d4841d3d9ac2d95392f2bf1f478882d2f3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a5ab2f928d89d1cd26b5c343cdad0ed35ad9ccbc25cf6bdd38704b17f8746bc9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "六鷁退飛，為襄敗祥。陳師合戰，左股疾傷。遂以崩薨，霸功不成。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e37ce56adb38e4f934089a55e81dc7aefb725a70c253c88fdd0eb5661141464d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d6d40a6542dfea985e2e3f6acd32214d746a8ecf9953eb91a573ed8900ba0778"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "異國殊俗，情不相得。金木為仇，酋賊擅役。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:31918a3d678f17779a47ed16835530ae2853ebd539abacfb52eb3bf258cd851b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:030e6e27f8549054ce70d5a4ca28385f2c94a133005430698b2a697174cb6fd1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "鴉噪庭中，以戒災凶。重門擊柝，儕憂暴客。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:430d822713ec5e83df0d8a3edc333d60274189ae48d39d454742fd316b3dbf47",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3f32c4197b78b8979d5a98c839fa4c618a9e1cd2c100692bbf2bd893395adc25"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "慈母赤子，享賜得士。獲夷服除，以安王家。側陋逢時。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7bf84aa8ca24e51d3a3747f2d4948f7c8673193784161c89c1d5f35feacb54c8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:337a61b6692e6029d191034baa70ba3845f2b8bfc665dcdd903b100f37ec372c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "跡造惡人，使得不通。炎旱為殃，年穀大傷。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f2735d27b3d80132f43372535e1f4ed7b6e6ee164f12ef45769ae90c59395055",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": true,
      "textSha256": "sha256:50bd0300dff0b8959eee5e011e0020c1fc17b73b539335bbca7a3bac7990c3f6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "躬履孔德，以帶束帶。文王燎獵，呂尚獲福。號稱太師，封建齊國。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ec7cdb2a4c45e6c1663f2855a01f46d92ec506e9aa395d13371654c64332359b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cc75a80e2e04a7d485789486ea24011f96190b1c387676f89f2e566e01255598"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "征將止惡，鼓鞞除賊。慶仲奔莒，子般獲福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6f8afcac727f687142c51a1473c7fedb52851fadcaf77bde50d466feedb69399",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:075cacbd5ebdb7518de6505ec94e068f4a757c6a181df78663ffa266187dac09"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "良夫淑女，配合相保。多孫壽子，歡樂長久。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b89beff808d11e33d650c468defac8c98ca18b288131e8ccd82b8ba63d9b6e94",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:71888b426630f871fc082b8d3e79445dbf2616b3656256eeb19c40da539fa8dd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "逶迤四牡，思念父母。王事靡盬，不得安處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e3619b0864c79624c987b373e6ff62b030e45e1acb6974b28dd4a141d40bae63",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e08c7a438fea2a910082d222f31f53e3d3f962a94b5e42fefa8c383bbf6e291f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "水壞我里，東流為海。龜鼉讙囂，不得安居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a965ea49bf7e7f48bddc5365a86b73f7cf9001582709c7d5420984ba95320255",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4f4103720fcffde87deea8daf72a3f2a93898bdf95fce1b5ab710065fbdec7bd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "束帛戔戔，賻我盂空。徵召送君，處號易子。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:dcfec07ef01f0d6ecf562921c93098f39fd2f99e9e757951543e82744cddbeba",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4057abf50df45469cc6bf40c31ff83458d223e80fdcce524c258c0f4fc63949b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "乾行大德，履贍六合。嘔喣成熟，使我福德。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:400321a715e2fe2f3b150e5a3311157a7fe12953d49cdc4e8df0367787c5eb21",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c928d1e8f30f8bbcd1fa2d4164196811b4dc41078b1491ebd2e202f755093f62"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "秦併六國，更相克賊。獲惠質圉，鄭被其咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d452936c2dc37e75a58273959f16898e75192269ae561fe30e6d38f517a73f8a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e87812962747cbbfca4108114ee47e1ec72a829ed120b7091a0a2b9ddb2610ba"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "晦昧昏冥，君無紀綱。甲子成亂，簡公喪亡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3803b24e1ca795f99ddb5df624b8bd0d7aca0b0154d09947f93ec6a12d1b53f9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4cc8c4ae1519ca387da8e31a3ac97a6795123c3987907848ddcffd87c5e5af2f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "三足無頭，弗知所之。心狂精傷，莫使為明。不見日光",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d1acd586238be7dcafcc129e8cc3a01cb1db5526ebb4351e359fbc892e520c71",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1af5e53f5efb61968b5e32b47a85e7f875e366e9aa3541bcacf14b1b0a24c4f6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "長夜短日，陰為陽賊。萬物空枯，藏於北陸。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5ab92c9740ee5babcbf055606cbbd61ea758cfe04c938e11fb1d7b66c78cd046",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8cdf8c2e7f16a50dd51d253b16580294f69077d952dfaad81690f1413138c46a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "依宵夜遊，與君相遭。除煩解惑，使我無憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cd82c3a8bc269c50e7d1fb425df3bb330ff05d258225d098fc0bfa6612d9f893",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f83d3e864047d269d8b49b2d098be8f5282a28a306b6cb0064e8ecfe59f93972"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "逐鹿南山，知我入門。陰陽和調，國無災殘。長子出逃，須其仁君。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6a5ed2d855cda6af61552b53e49ccb69e738b013bc074e202cf2c07e60097812",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:302db31338bece4946510bfc8ec63e23f1edfaff79c20eeeedede94ba1c634da"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 56,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "請騁作耳，嗇不我與，驅我父母。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ff910569798189934f7dc72390125e922633cd364067ba8ad12767ccfd2fd778",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ef2d5c1cd5dfcfbbe92dd9f808a77affc852fe8c2dc67b4ad0ca1bb7f1ad659c"
    }
  ]
}
